Alpine Linux 3.24 container component notices

Scope

This file covers the operating-system packages inherited by the production container from the Dockerfile-pinned Alpine 3.24 image index:

  alpine:3.24@sha256:28bd5fe8b56d1bd048e5babf5b10710ebe0bae67db86916198a6eec434943f8b

Both linux/amd64 and linux/arm64 currently resolve the same package/version set. The image-generated /opt/fingrind/doc/ALPINE-PACKAGES.tsv is authoritative for an individual image and records the exact package set, source-package origin, Alpine packaging commit, declared license expression, and upstream URL. If that generated inventory differs from the static baseline below, publication must stop until this file is reviewed.

Exact baseline package families and governing material

- alpine-baselayout 3.7.2-r1, alpine-baselayout-data 3.7.2-r1: GPL-2.0-only; full text in LICENSE-GPL-2.0; corresponding source covered by SOURCE_OFFER.md.
- alpine-keys 2.6-r0: declared MIT; package recipe and contributor/maintainer provenance at Alpine aports commit b9f23becced4d7b3ccc0fa0f28530243ccd314a0.
- alpine-release 3.24.1-r0: declared MIT; generated release data and recipe provenance at Alpine aports commit 0934530484bbcde7498e2c694c710a49616a450e.
- apk-tools 3.0.6-r0 and libapk 3.0.6-r0: GPL-2.0-only; full text in LICENSE-GPL-2.0; corresponding source covered by SOURCE_OFFER.md.
- busybox 1.37.0-r31, busybox-binsh 1.37.0-r31, ssl_client 1.37.0-r31: GPL-2.0-only; full text in LICENSE-GPL-2.0; corresponding source covered by SOURCE_OFFER.md.
- ca-certificates-bundle 20260611-r0: MPL-2.0 AND MIT; full MPL text in LICENSE-MPL-2.0; exact source/recipe at Alpine aports commit e41cbd2ae991adfe8df298ba8e8e777e90bd0e03 and https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/ca-certificates/-/tree/20260611.
- libcrypto3 3.5.7-r0 and libssl3 3.5.7-r0: Apache-2.0; full text in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0. Copyright (c) 1998-2026 The OpenSSL Project Authors. Copyright (c) 1995-1998 Eric A. Young and Tim J. Hudson. Source: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/tree/openssl-3.5.7.
